{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "\"assert X contains Y\" must build Container=X (the haystack), Value=Y (the needle), not swapped.\n%t% = \"hello world\" contains \"world\" and does not contain \"xyz\". With the operands swapped\n(Container=\"world\", Value=%t%) the first assert asks \"does 'world' contain 'hello world'\" and fails —\nthat is how the .pr mutation proves this red.",
